      "question": "------- of the management team include improving productivity and reducing annual expenditures.",
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "topic": "语法与词汇",
      "keywords": "grammar vocabulary collocation",
      "answer_explain": "空格是主语的核心词，of the management team 是后置修饰语。谓语 include 为复数主语形式，应选复数名词 Priorities；单数 Priority 应配 includes，Prioritizing 和 Prioritized 不是这里所需的复数名词。",
